  "cause": "The CI wrapper exports TMPDIR inside the repository ignored tmp directory. The original unit-test TemporaryDirectory therefore nests its fixture inside that ignored directory. git -C fixture ls-files succeeds through the parent repository but reports no fixture files because they are ignored. gold_star.git_files only falls back to filesystem scanning after a Git error, so its successful empty result bypasses the fallback and omits gamma.gd. validate produces no missing-catalogue error, making the original assertion fail. This is temporary-root Git discovery/ignore behavior, not a POSIX-versus-backslash diagnostic difference.",
